OL,3,GNEWSAKing Charles praises Welsh 'sense
OL,4,Aof belonging' as he opens Senedd
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 30 protesters by the steps of the
OL,7,FSenedd were vocal throughout the royal
OL,8,Fvisit, and one protester was arrested
OL,9,Fon suspicion of breaching the Public
OL,10,FOrder Act.
